{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2019-12-03 10:30:00', 'title': 'MESA AIR GROUP ADDS NEW AIRCRAFT, EXTENDS CONTRACT WITH UNITED AIRLINES', 'text': "MESA AIR GROUP ADDS NEW AIRCRAFT, EXTENDS CONTRACT WITH UNITED AIRLINES.MESA AIR GROUP INC - IT WILL ADD 20 NEW EMBRAER E175 LL AIRCRAFT TO ITS UNITED EXPRESS FLEET.MESA AIR GROUP INC - AIRCRAFT WILL BE OWNED AND FINANCED BY MESA AND BE COVERED UNDER A 12-YEAR CAPACITY PURCHASE AGREEMENT.MESA AIR GROUP INC - DELIVERIES ARE SCHEDULED TO BEGIN MAY 2020 AND EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED BY END OF 2020.MESA AIR GROUP INC - PARTIES ARE ALSO EXTENDING CONTRACT FOR 42 E175S FOR AN ADDITIONAL FIVE YEARS.MESA AIR GROUP INC - AIRCRAFT, WHICH ARE OWNED BY UNITED, ARE NOW CONTRACTED THROUGH END OF 2024 WITH RIGHTS TO EXTEND THROUGH 2027.MESA AIR GROUP INC - 18 MESA-OWNED E175S ARE CONTRACTED THROUGH 2028..MESA AIR GROUP - IN CONNECTION WITH DEAL, MESA'S 20 BOMBARDIER CRJ-700 AIRCRAFT WILL BE LEASED TO ANOTHER UNITED EXPRESS CARRIER FOR A TERM OF 7 YEARS."}{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2019-12-03 10:30:00', 'title': 'MESA AIR GROUP ADDS NEW AIRCRAFT, EXTENDS CONTRACT WITH UNITED AIRLINES', 'text': "MESA AIR GROUP ADDS NEW AIRCRAFT, EXTENDS CONTRACT WITH UNITED AIRLINES.MESA AIR GROUP INC - IT WILL ADD 20 NEW EMBRAER E175 LL AIRCRAFT TO ITS UNITED EXPRESS FLEET.MESA AIR GROUP INC - AIRCRAFT WILL BE OWNED AND FINANCED BY MESA AND BE COVERED UNDER A 12-YEAR CAPACITY PURCHASE AGREEMENT.MESA AIR GROUP INC - DELIVERIES ARE SCHEDULED TO BEGIN MAY 2020 AND EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED BY END OF 2020.MESA AIR GROUP INC - PARTIES ARE ALSO EXTENDING CONTRACT FOR 42 E175S FOR AN ADDITIONAL FIVE YEARS.MESA AIR GROUP INC - AIRCRAFT, WHICH ARE OWNED BY UNITED, ARE NOW CONTRACTED THROUGH END OF 2024 WITH RIGHTS TO EXTEND THROUGH 2027.MESA AIR GROUP INC - 18 MESA-OWNED E175S ARE CONTRACTED THROUGH 2028..MESA AIR GROUP - IN CONNECTION WITH DEAL, MESA'S 20 BOMBARDIER CRJ-700 AIRCRAFT WILL BE LEASED TO ANOTHER UNITED EXPRESS CARRIER FOR A TERM OF 7 YEARS."}{'symbol': 'UA